## **💡 KEY INSIGHTS FROM REAL INTERVIEWS:**

### **Microsoft SDE-2 Pattern:**
- ✅ **Heavy on:** Intervals, Meeting Rooms, Graphs, Design
- ✅ **Coding:** 2-3 DSA rounds (Medium-Hard)
- ✅ **System Design:** Low-Level + High-Level Design
- ✅ **Common:** Asteroid Collision, Cheapest Flights, LRU Cache

### **Salesforce Pattern:**
- ✅ **Heavy on:** DP (Knapsack variants), Linked Lists, Stacks
- ✅ **Coding:** 2 DSA rounds (Medium difficulty)
- ✅ **Less common:** Very hard problems
- ✅ **Common:** Detect Cycle, Valid Parentheses, Array manipulation

### **eBay Pattern:**
- ✅ **Heavy on:** Graphs (Islands), DP, Two Pointers
- ✅ **Coding:** 3 LC Medium rounds
- ✅ **System Design:** 1 round
- ✅ **Common:** Graph traversal, DP on grids

### **Freshworks Pattern:**
- ✅ **Heavy on:** LRU Cache, Array manipulation, System Design
- ✅ **Coding:** 1-2 DSA rounds
- ✅ **Strong focus:** Backend concepts, DB design
- ✅ **Common:** Stock problems, LRU Cache

